  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When sleepless Bu Xiaogu returns to Xingtian from the police station, Xiaoye whispers that Twelve Singers has been suspended, and PR director Stella confronts Xiaogu in the corridor. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "节目停播整改了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "高层在里面开会已经好几个小时了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "听说董事长也连夜赶飞机回来了，以前真从来没有过这种情况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你是布小谷吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天的历史上，从来没有人被警察带出过公司，你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那可是十二歌王的决赛之夜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你现在怎么样都不重要了，星天一定会开除你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "理由就是重大公关事故。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据公司的规定，我这个公关总监签字就能立即生效。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "节目停播整改了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The show has been taken off the air for overhaul.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "高层在里面开会已经好几个小时了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Senior executives have been in a meeting inside for several hours already.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "听说董事长也连夜赶飞机回来了，以前真从来没有过这种情况。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard the chairwoman flew back overnight too; nothing like this ever happened before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你是布小谷吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are Bu Xiaogu, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I am.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天的历史上，从来没有人被警察带出过公司，你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In Xingtian's history, nobody has ever been led out by police, do you know that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那可是十二歌王的决赛之夜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That was the finale night of Twelve Singers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你现在怎么样都不重要了，星天一定会开除你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How things stand with you no longer matters; Xingtian will certainly dismiss you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "理由就是重大公关事故。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The reason is a major public-relations incident.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据公司的规定，我这个公关总监签字就能立即生效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Under company rules, my signature as public-relations director takes immediate effect.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "节目停播整改了。",
      "gap": 0.5
